# ⭕ Eternal Cyclical Steam
# Steam that flows in eternal cycles

# Visual:
#   ⭕ { 🔥 + 💧 }
#
# Meaning: Fire-water fusion flowing in eternal circles
# Directionality: CYCLICAL (eternal, circular flow)
# Structure: DIRECTIONAL marker wrapping TRANSFORMER
#
# This sigil represents the eternal water cycle:
#   Water → Fire (evaporation) → Steam → Water → repeat ⭕

circle lbrace fire plus water rbrace
